From: xiexgxgxgxg <xiangtaozichidexie@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 16:44:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] cameraserver: preload the 6.0.1 camera HAL shims

The Samsung 6.0.1 camera HAL expects the legacy camera_metadata and
camera parameter APIs, which the shim libraries in the device tree
provide.  Without them cameraserver talks to the HAL with the wrong
structures and no camera can be opened.

Change-Id: I026fdd0be199c6e088922341a5707b2a60624f60
---
 camera/cameraserver/cameraserver.rc | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/camera/cameraserver/cameraserver.rc b/camera/cameraserver/cameraserver.rc
index 8f51458d7f..1e1b19692e 100644
--- a/camera/cameraserver/cameraserver.rc
+++ b/camera/cameraserver/cameraserver.rc
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
 service cameraserver /system/bin/cameraserver
+    setenv LD_PRELOAD "/system/lib/libcamparams_shim_sys.so /system/lib/libcammetadata_legacy_sys.so"
     class main
     user cameraserver
     group audio camera input drmrpc
-- 
2.53.0

